          {
            "title": "Intro",
            "id": 126739,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Untuk membuat keputusan yang lebih cerdas dalam program kita, kita memerlukan pernyataan <code>if</code> yang mengandalkan kondisi yang lebih cerdas seperti dalam aplikasi trivia di bawah ini.</p><webview version=\"2\" content=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;&#xA;&lt;html&gt;&#xA; &lt;head&gt;&#xA;  &lt;style&gt;&#xA;   body {&#xA;    text-align: center;&#xA;    font-size: 20px;&#xA;    margin: 0 auto;&#xA;    height: 400px;&#xA;   }&#xA;   &#xA;   button {&#xA;    width: 200px;&#xA;    height: 30px;&#xA;    font-size: 20px;&#xA;    border-radius: 5px;&#xA;    margin: 0 auto;&#xA;    display: block;&#xA;    background-color: #6d3acf;&#xA;    color: white;&#xA;    outline: none;&#xA;   }&#xA;   &#xA;   .radioDiv {&#xA;    margin: 0 auto;&#xA;    width: auto;&#xA;    text-align: left;&#xA;    display: table;&#xA;   }&#xA;   &#xA;   .questionDiv {&#xA;    border: 1px solid #f0f5fd;&#xA;    border-radius: 20px;&#xA;    padding-top: 10px;&#xA;    padding-bottom: 20px;&#xA;    padding-left: 10px;&#xA;    padding-right: 10px;&#xA;    width: 300px;&#xA;    height: 200px;&#xA;    background-color: #d9e8fb;&#xA;    margin: 0 auto;&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/style&gt;&#xA; &lt;/head&gt;&#xA; &lt;body id=&quot;main&quot;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;h1&gt;Trivia Time&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&quot;questionDiv&quot;&gt;&#xA;   &lt;h3&gt;Which painter was born in Spain?&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;   &lt;div class=&quot;radioDiv&quot;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;input type=&quot;radio&quot; name=&quot;painter&quot; value=&quot;picasso&quot;&gt; Picasso&lt;br&gt;&#xA;    &lt;input type=&quot;radio&quot; name=&quot;painter&quot; value=&quot;matisse&quot;&gt;&#xA;    Matisse&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;   &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;   &lt;button onClick=&quot;check()&quot;&gt;Submit&lt;/button&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;script&gt;&#xA;   function check() {&#xA;    let feedback = document.getElementById(&quot;feedback&quot;);&#xA;    let radios = document.getElementsByName('painter');&#xA;    let body = document.getElementById(&quot;main&quot;);&#xA;    if (feedback !== null) {&#xA;     body.removeChild(feedback);&#xA;    }&#xA;    for (var i = 0, length = radios.length; i &lt; length; i++) {&#xA;     let paragraph = document.createElement(&quot;p&quot;);&#xA;     paragraph.id = &quot;feedback&quot;;&#xA;     console.log(&quot;checking&quot;);&#xA;     if (radios[i].checked) {&#xA;      console.log(&quot;found&quot;);&#xA;      if (radios[i].value === &quot;picasso&quot;) {&#xA;       paragraph.innerHTML = &quot;Correct!&quot;;&#xA;       paragraph.style.color = &quot;#62d76b&quot;;&#xA;      } else {&#xA;       paragraph.innerHTML = &quot;Not quite!&quot;;&#xA;       paragraph.style.color = &quot;#d7465f&quot;;&#xA;      }&#xA;      body.appendChild(paragraph);&#xA;      break;&#xA;     }&#xA;    }&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/script&gt;&#xA; &lt;/body&gt;&#xA;&lt;/html&gt;\" /></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Intro 2",
            "id": 126740,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aplikasi ini menampilkan <code>Correct!</code> jika pengguna mengirimkan jawaban yang benar dan <code>Not quite!</code> jika pengguna mengirimkan jawaban yang salah.</p><webview version=\"2\" content=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;&#xA;&lt;html&gt;&#xA; &lt;head&gt;&#xA;  &lt;style&gt;&#xA;   body {&#xA;    text-align: center;&#xA;    font-size: 20px;&#xA;    margin: 0 auto;&#xA;    height: 400px;&#xA;   }&#xA;   &#xA;   button {&#xA;    width: 200px;&#xA;    height: 30px;&#xA;    font-size: 20px;&#xA;    border-radius: 5px;&#xA;    margin: 0 auto;&#xA;    display: block;&#xA;    background-color: #6d3acf;&#xA;    color: white;&#xA;    outline: none;&#xA;   }&#xA;   &#xA;   .radioDiv {&#xA;    margin: 0 auto;&#xA;    width: auto;&#xA;    text-align: left;&#xA;    display: table;&#xA;   }&#xA;   &#xA;   .questionDiv {&#xA;    border: 1px solid #f0f5fd;&#xA;    border-radius: 20px;&#xA;    padding-top: 10px;&#xA;    padding-bottom: 20px;&#xA;    padding-left: 10px;&#xA;    padding-right: 10px;&#xA;    width: 300px;&#xA;    height: 200px;&#xA;    background-color: #d9e8fb;&#xA;    margin: 0 auto;&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/style&gt;&#xA; &lt;/head&gt;&#xA; &lt;body id=&quot;main&quot;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;h1&gt;Trivia Time&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&quot;questionDiv&quot;&gt;&#xA;   &lt;h3&gt;Which painter was born in Spain?&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;   &lt;div class=&quot;radioDiv&quot;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;input type=&quot;radio&quot; name=&quot;painter&quot; value=&quot;picasso&quot;&gt; Picasso&lt;br&gt;&#xA;    &lt;input type=&quot;radio&quot; name=&quot;painter&quot; value=&quot;matisse&quot;&gt;&#xA;    Matisse&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;   &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;   &lt;button onClick=&quot;check()&quot;&gt;Submit&lt;/button&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;script&gt;&#xA;   function check() {&#xA;    let feedback = document.getElementById(&quot;feedback&quot;);&#xA;    let radios = document.getElementsByName('painter');&#xA;    let body = document.getElementById(&quot;main&quot;);&#xA;    if (feedback !== null) {&#xA;     body.removeChild(feedback);&#xA;    }&#xA;    for (let i = 0, length = radios.length; i &lt; length; i++) {&#xA;     let paragraph = document.createElement(&quot;p&quot;);&#xA;     paragraph.id = &quot;feedback&quot;;&#xA;     console.log(&quot;checking&quot;);&#xA;     if (radios[i].checked) {&#xA;      console.log(&quot;found&quot;);&#xA;      if (radios[i].value === &quot;picasso&quot;) {&#xA;       paragraph.innerHTML = &quot;Correct!&quot;;&#xA;       paragraph.style.color = &quot;#62d76b&quot;;&#xA;      } else {&#xA;       paragraph.innerHTML = &quot;Not quite!&quot;;&#xA;       paragraph.style.color = &quot;#d7465f&quot;;&#xA;      }&#xA;      body.appendChild(paragraph);&#xA;      break;&#xA;     }&#xA;    }&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/script&gt;&#xA; &lt;/body&gt;&#xA;&lt;/html&gt;\" /></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Correct answers",
            "id": 126741,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Program seperti itu menggunakan operator <code>==</code> untuk memeriksa apakah <code>answer</code> seorang peserta dalam kuis trivia sudah benar.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" answer = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Picasso&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" answer == \" /><text value=\"&quot;Picasso&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;\\(answer) is correct!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"33\" endIndex=\"35\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Picasso is correct!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>==</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Wrong answers",
            "id": 126742,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bagaimana jika jawaban kuis trivia tidak benar? Kita bisa menggunakan <code>!=</code> untuk memeriksa apakah <code>answer</code> tidak sama dengan <code>\"Picasso\"</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" answer = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Matisse&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" answer != \" /><text value=\"&quot;Picasso&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(answer + \" /><text value=\"&quot; is wrong!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"answer == &quot;Picasso&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Matisse is wrong!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>answer != \"Picasso\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Different comparisons",
            "id": 126743,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>  Pernyataan <code>if</code> bekerja dengan semua operator perbandingan yang sudah kita pelajari sejauh ini. Misalnya, memeriksa apakah <code>age</code> lebih besar dari atau sama dengan <code>55</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" age = \" /><text value=\"75\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" age &gt;= \" /><text value=\"55\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Discount applied&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;=\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Discount applied\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>age</code>, diikuti oleh <code>&gt;=</code>, dan terakhir <code>55</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Condition",
            "id": 126744,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>  Pernyataan <code>if</code> tidak harus menggunakan operator khusus untuk membandingkan variabel seperti <code>isDay</code> dengan nilai boolean.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isDay = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isDay {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Lights off!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Lights off!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>isDay</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Variables",
            "id": 126745,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Untuk menggunakan hasil perbandingan beberapa kali, kita bisa menyimpannya dalam variabel seperti <code>pass</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score = \" /><text value=\"51\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" pass = score &gt; \" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" pass {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(pass)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"44\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>pass</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Good decisions",
            "id": 126746,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Mengapa kita menggunakan perbandingan dengan pernyataan <code>if</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Untuk membuat keputusan yang lebih cerdas tentang menjalankan atau melewati kode</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Untuk selalu menjalankan blok pernyataan if</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Untuk membuat keputusan yang lebih cerdas tentang menjalankan atau melewati kode.</p></body></html>"
          },
